==Trivia==
*It is possible that Qifrey’s [[Giant Water Puppet of Diversion]] is a watersculpture, seeing as it takes on the shape of [[The Guardian of the Tower of Tomes]] and is introduced in the [[Great Hall Arc]], a story arc in which sculpting spells are first introduced and brought up frequently.{{Ref|m|37|9-10}}
